  "name": "dsh-privacy-mode",
  "title": {
    "en": "Privacy Mode",
    "zh": "隐私模式"
  },
  "description": {
    "en": "Asymmetric visibility: mark plugins, workspaces and chats private, and they are absent in NORMAL (not composed, no tools, no prompt text) while PRIVATE brings the whole profile back behind a password or Windows Hello / Touch ID.",
    "zh": "非对称可见性：把插件、工作区、对话标记为隐私，常规模式下它们不存在（不参与组合、没有工具、没有提示词），隐私模式输密码或用系统指纹后整份 profile 恢复。"
  },
